{
  "tools": {
    "wps_ppt_set_shape_border": {
      "description": "设置幻灯片中指定形状的边框样式。\n\nborder对象属性：\n- enabled: 是否启用边框 (boolean)\n- color: 边框颜色，如 \"#000000\"\n- weight: 边框粗细（磅）\n- style: 边框样式，如 \"solid\"(实线)、\"dash\"(虚线)、\"dot\"(点线)\n\n使用场景：\n- \"给形状加边框\"\n- \"设置红色虚线边框\"",
      "maps_to": "wps_ppt_set_shape_border",
      "server": "wps-office",
      "inputSchema": {
        "properties": {
          "border": {
            "description": "边框配置对象",
            "properties": {
              "color": {
                "description": "边框颜色",
                "type": "string"
              },
              "enabled": {
                "description": "是否启用边框",
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "style": {
                "description": "边框样式",
                "enum": [
                  "solid",
                  "dash",
                  "dot",
                  "dash_dot",
                  "dash_dot_dot"
                ],
                "type": "string"
              },
              "weight": {
                "description": "边框粗细（磅）",
                "type": "number"
              }
            },
            "type": "object"
          },
          "shapeIndex": {
            "description": "形状索引（从1开始）",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "slideIndex": {
            "description": "幻灯片页码（从1开始）",
            "type": "number"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "slideIndex",
          "shapeIndex",
          "border"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      }
    }
  }
}
